# -------------------------------------------------------
# calculate the resolution field h(x,y)
# and h=ax+b linear variation with distance dfield(x,y,z)
#
# The floor and ceiling functions set the minimum value of h (floor)
# and maximum value of h (ceiling)
#
#              ceiling
#            /--------
#           /
#          / h=ax+b
#         /
# -------/
# floor
#
# Test suite copy of the user's demo_user_resolution_01.mlgi. Changes:
# the dump name poisson_h_of_x_y.inp -> out_letters_h_field.inp, and
# that dump is commented out (see below).
#
compute / distance_field / mo_poi_h_field / mo_LaGriT_refine / dfield
math/multiply/mo_poi_h_field/h_field_att/1,0,0/mo_poi_h_field/dfield/SLOPE/
cmo / printatt / mo_poi_h_field / dfield / minmax
math/add/mo_poi_h_field/h_field_att/1,0,0/mo_poi_h_field/h_field_att/INTERCEPT/
cmo / printatt / mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / minmax
math / floor   / mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / 1 0 0 / &
                 mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / H_FLOOR
cmo / printatt / mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / minmax
math / ceiling / mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / 1 0 0 / &
                 mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / H_CEILING
cmo / printatt / mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / minmax
#
# -------------------------------------------------------
#
# In order to visualize the h(x,y) field, the user can output
# mo_poi_h_field and look at the attribute h_field_att.
# Output will slow things down so output should be commented out
# in production runs.
#
# COMMENTED OUT in the test suite (Oct 10 2026): the field lives on the
# driver's lookup grid, 3.5 million points at h 0.16 (about 0.5 GB of
# AVS text, more as h gets finer), so writing it and checking it is
# big and slow. The suite does not test AVS output, and the h field is
# not needed to judge the mesh: the checker computes h itself from
# out_letters_refine.inp. Uncomment the dump line to look at the field
# in ParaView; the checker's field row then checks it too (it reports
# SKIP while the line is commented out).

cmo / printatt / mo_poi_h_field / h_field_att / minmax
# dump / avs / out_letters_h_field.inp / mo_poi_h_field / 1 3 1 1

finish
